# ── API base URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Leave unset for local dev — Vite's proxy (/api → localhost:4000) handles it.
# Set this on Vercel (or any production host) to point at your deployed backend:
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
VITE_API_URL=
